1 NAME Sayyid Ahmad Khamil / Panglima Daik "Tok Kayo Hitam"
2 GIVN Sayyid Ahmad Khamil / Panglima Daik "Tok Kayo Hitam"
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1483
