2 CONT
2 CONT Version 1 (MKJK) : many articles of this version, one from document " Mengenal Kampung Jatinegara Kaum" in PosKota referenced: "Kampung Tua di Jakarta" by Dinas Museum dan Sejarah, 1993; Ratu Bagus Angke or Tubagus Angke married R
2 CONC atu Pembayun, Ratu Pembayun daughter of Maulana Hasanuddin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Version 2 (AST) : from document "Aneka Sejarah Tubagus" by FBGroup: "Tubagus and Ratu Clan"; Ratu Bagus Angke or Pangeran Djaya Ki Gedeng Angke married to Ratu Ayu, Ratu Ayu daughter of Fatahillah and Ratu Mas Ayu Pakuan Dyah, Rat
2 CONC u Mas Ayu Pakuan Dyah daughter of Syarif Hidatullah Mahdumdjati Tjirebon.
2 CONT
