1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Datu Kelantan Barat c1698-c1713.
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Tuan Sulung bin Wan Daim, Datu Pasir, of Patani and of Kelantan Barat (West Kelantan) 1698-1713.  He d. ca. 1715, having had issue, two sons:
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) Tuan Long Pandak bin Tuan Sulung, Dato' Sri Maharaja of Kelantan Barat,  who succeeded as Paduka Sri Raja Long Pandak ibni al-Marhum Tuan Sulong, Raja of Kelantan
2 CONT
2 CONT (2) Tuan Long Muhammad, Raja Muda, who succeeded as Paduka Sri Raja Long Muhammad ibni al-Marhum Tuan Sulong, Raja of Kelantan 
