1 NAME Long Nik Datu Pujud /Wan Daim/
2 GIVN Long Nik Datu Pujud
2 _MARNM Wan Daim
1 NAME Long Nik Datu Pujud Patani - Raja Reman
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Datu Pujud, Patani.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Datu Kelantan Barat c1698-c1713.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Tuan Long Nik bin Wan Daim, Dato' Pujud, of Rehman, in Upper Perak. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He had issue, three sons and one daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) Tuan Long Nuh, Dato' Pujud, who became Paduka Sri Raja Nuh bin Long Nik, Raja of Patani 
2 CONT
2 CONT (2) Tuan Long Man bin Long Nik. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (3) Tuan Long Gaffar [Ga'apar] bin Long Nik, Tengku Sri Maharaja Perdana Mantri.  Appointed as Chief Minister by Long Yunus of Kelantan with the title of Tengku Sri Maharaja Perdana Mantri, before 12th July 1763. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) Tuan Engku (Tengku) Tengah. m. Paduka Sri Raja Long Pandak ibni al-Marhum Tuan Sulong, Raja of Kelantan. She was k. by her hsuband who suspected her fidelity, at Fort Kubang Labu, Kelantan, 1758 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref: [http://www.royalark.net/Malaysia/kelant3.htm]
