1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sunan Parung 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sunan Corenda.
2 CONT
2 CONT Raja Talaga abt 1450 - 1500.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes on May 18, 2009:
2 CONT
2 CONT His name in Joyce FG: Sunan Parung, link to his other profile:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geni.com/people/Sunan-Parung/6000000003010988737
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sunan Parung did not reign for long, only for a few years. The most important development during his reign was that he established Government Representatives known as "Dalem" - placed in Kulur, Sindangkasih, Jerokaso Maja.
2 CONT
2 CONT He only had one daughter, named Ratu Sunyalarang or Ratu Parung (Queen Sunyalarang, Queen of Parung). 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''DECEASED'''
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''DECEASED'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Lokasi Makam:
2 CONT https://maps.app.goo.gl/DosQGpfhqRLg7oUg8
