1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 5) Y.B.M. Tengku Muhammad ibni al-Marhum Sultan Muhammad IV [Mohamed], Tengku Kaya Perkasa, educ. Malay Coll, Kuala Kangsar. Cmsnd as 2nd-Lieut Kelantan Volunteer Force, prom Lieut 1937, Probationer Customs Dept 19
2 CONC 37, Mbr Montri Sapha (Council of Ministers) 1944-1945, DO Tumpet 1956-1957, MLA for Pasir Puteh Utara 1957-1963, MEC 1957-1960. Vice-Presdt Kelantan Badminton Assoc 1939. Mbr Badminton Assoc of Malaya. m. Y.M. Tuan Sharifa Zainab 
2 CONC binti Sayyid Ahmad, daughter of Sayyid Ahmad bin Sayyid Daud, by his wife, Tuan Siti Fatima. He had issue, two daughters:
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Y.M. Tengku Zainimah binti Tengku Muhammad. m. Y.M. Sayyid Noh bin Sayyid Omar. She had issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT b) Y.M. Tengku Noor Mariam binti Tengku Muhammad. m. Encik Shukri bin ‘Abdu’llah . She had issue, two sons and one daughter.
